    w: 1, title: "Made for Relationship", theme: "God made us for fellowship with him and with one another, so friendship is part of his good design and not an optional extra",
    summary: "From the first pages of Scripture, God declares that it is not good for man to be alone. This lesson studies Genesis 2:18, Ecclesiastes 4:9-12, Genesis 1:26-27, John 17:20-23 and Acts 2:42-47 to see that the triune God lives in relationship, that we bear his image as relational beings, that two are better than one, and that the church is meant to be a family of friends.",
