    intro: "Then the Lord God said, It is not good that the man should be alone; I will make him a helper fit for him. Two are better than one, because they have a good reward for their toil. For if they fall, one will lift up his fellow. But woe to him who is alone when he falls and has not another to lift him up! Before there was any sin, God observed that isolation was not good. We were made for one another.",
