    sa: ["How can believers keep friendships with the opposite sex pure?", ["family", "purity", "boundaries", "respect", "flee", "accountability"], "A good answer says believers treat each other as family in Christ, set practical boundaries, avoid temptation, respect and honour one another, seek accountability and rely on God's grace."],
