    summary: "This session reviews lessons 1 to 12: made for relationship, David and Jonathan, Jesus as friend, marks of a godly friend, choosing companions wisely, bad company, loyalty and betrayal, honest friends and accountability, peer pressure, friendship in the digital age, friendship between men and women, and courtship principles. It prepares learners for the mid-session test.",
    scripture: ["Proverbs 17:17", "Proverbs 13:20"], more: ["Ecclesiastes 4:9-10", "John 15:13", "Hebrews 10:24"], memory: "Proverbs 27:17",
