    apply: "Write a one-page summary of the first twelve lessons with a Scripture reference for each key idea. Review it twice before the test. Share one lesson with a friend and thank God in prayer for the friends he has given you.",
    activity: "Play a team review game. The teacher reads a clue such as a threefold cord or iron sharpening iron and teams call out the topic and a passage. Give extra points for application. End by reading Ecclesiastes 4:9-12 together.",
    takeHome: "Prepare for the test by reviewing the revision map and memory verses. Write five practice questions with answers and test someone.",
